Faibot M1: display meshes for the MuJoCo simulation
Copyright (c) 2026 Leo Dao (Faibotic)

The *.stl files here are generated by cad/faibotic/export_sim_meshes.py --pl
(STEP tessellated, merged per MJCF body and material, converted to metres in
the body frame at SDK pose 0). 42 files; SHA-256 of each file in meshes.json.
The right arm is the y-mirror of the left arm. hardware/urdf/assets/ holds
byte copies of the same files, under the same licences.

Licence per file. The full list for the repository is in ../../NOTICE.

